{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":138310,\"title\":\"Ties That Bind\",\"tagline\":\"\",\"overview\":\"Adobea, Buki and Theresa are three women from different walks of life bound together by a similar pain; the loss of a child. In a destined meeting in a small village in Kroboland, the women journey together to redemption, love, life and forgiveness as they renovate a dilapidated clinic for the villagers.\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/c2QjW6jx5mZ7E1lN8WIlDhflJb7.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/cQ2lYE7Ktj3AF6nz5MUAk44ZExh.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"year\":2011,\"runtime\":111,\"genres\":[\"Drama\"],\"status\":\"Released\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"GH\",\"name\":\"Ghana\"},{\"code\":\"US\",\"name\":\"United States of America\"}],\"budget\":0,\"revenue\":0,\"director\":\"Leila Djansi\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":1108581,\"name\":\"Leila Djansi\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/6nR0NrARMojVbFpGm3J5t7yaTSn.jpg\"},{\"id\":55314,\"name\":\"Kimberly Elise\",\"character\":\"Theresa Harper\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/9Z2xlD8i8NXeT6NipPpmQfL6Mki.jpg\"},{\"id\":1082406,\"name\":\"Omotola Jalade-Ekeinde\",\"character\":\"Adobea Onyomena\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/7mjQqH4gczJYKOZymlTbKgh8Phi.jpg\"},{\"id\":1533157,\"name\":\"Ama K. Abebrese\",\"character\":\"Buki Ocansey\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/2lRC2rINPTcXA67obnaMSmrWiOH.jpg\"},{\"id\":1045170,\"name\":\"Kofi Adjorlolo\",\"character\":\"Father\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/rBNcpDNQ0wXYAOCpf6RvHUIatl1.jpg\"},{\"id\":1108592,\"name\":\"Khareemar Aguiar\",\"character\":\"Estelle\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":177213,\"name\":\"Ebbe Bassey\",\"character\":\"Maa Dede\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/pTtXI2qPr5ctkSgujkzYTjOGZ2H.jpg\"},{\"id\":36631,\"name\":\"Randall Batinkoff\",\"character\":\"Dan Dubick\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/tq4njPdsUNXjnIAnPetT6B423BW.jpg\"},{\"id\":1108594,\"name\":\"Mercedes Bey\",\"character\":\"Theresa's Mother\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":1108605,\"name\":\"Fiifi Coleman\",\"character\":\"Eddie\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":1108606,\"name\":\"Gladys Deku\",\"character\":\"White Garment Church Member\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":1108607,\"name\":\"David Dontoh\",\"character\":\"Koo\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":968813,\"name\":\"John Dumelo\",\"character\":\"Lucas Morison\",\"photo\":null}],\"similar\":[{\"id\":724495,\"title\":\"The Woman King\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/438QXt1E3WJWb3PqNniK0tAE5c1.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/dOtH7s8gIP6lt3WfeK4ws8udI3E.jpg\",\"rating\":7.5,\"year\":2022,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"The story of the Agojie, the all-female unit of warriors who protected the African Kingdom of Dahomey in the 1800s with skills and a fierceness unlike anything the world has ever seen, and General Nanisca as she trains the next generation of recruits and readies them for battle against an enemy determined to destroy their way of life.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Drama\",\"History\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":33997,\"title\":\"Desert Flower\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/fpAHsUmguktSveebXx2BNxUo0rh.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ivgsXGoQDskwfvyMJy7jgSfEsW.jpg\",\"rating\":7.6,\"year\":2009,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"The autobiography of a Somalian nomad who was sold in marriage at 13, fled from Africa a while later to become finally an American supermodel and is now at the age of 38, the UN spokeswoman against female genital mutilation.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":44716,\"title\":\"In a Better World\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/dJpPpgf2z5lNw6xVxvfWm0lexNH.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jso7QKHWwkdlEHFef68kFWHsltx.jpg\",\"rating\":7.1,\"year\":2010,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"The lives of two Danish families cross each other, and an extraordinary but risky friendship comes into bud. But loneliness, frailty and sorrow lie in wait.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":347026,\"title\":\"A United Kingdom\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/xyhoW9qK7ZaDM1V4A6pPL9DWjn8.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/cBlKxl2YSRVTLb1szSur8H3BNdZ.jpg\",\"rating\":6.6,\"year\":2016,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"The inspiring true story of Seretse Khama, the King of Bechuanaland (modern Botswana), and Ruth Williams, the London office worker he married in 1948 in the face of fierce opposition from their families and the British and South African governments. Seretse and Ruth defied family, Apartheid and empire - their love triumphed over every obstacle flung in their path and in so doing they transformed their nation and inspired the world.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"History\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":46207,\"title\":\"White Material\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/qqQOsXOf7HvoWVWjOLuKpGQFjMh.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/88wLsdc8aDTOJfJpJ1Ax3yOuoTe.jpg\",\"rating\":6.7,\"year\":2010,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"In the midst of a volatile regime change in a Francophone African state, Maria Vial is fighting to sustain her family’s coffee plantation. With rebels and the army struggling for control, French peacekeeping forces move out, warning the remaining white residents that they’re on their own. But Maria refuses to be driven off the land, even as tragedy looms.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":305464,\"title\":\"The Metropolitan Opera: Il Trovatore\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/lB6w0oW5yuGP2hLm9uBsJXz8AeR.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/cXUdqKxPjMMrTATF2Q1KcmUvHKy.jpg\",\"rating\":8,\"year\":2011,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Verdi’s IL TROVATORE again storms the Met stage in a star-studded, anvil-wielding cast , including Sondra Radvanovsky, Dolora Zajick and Dmitri Hvorostovsky. Marcelo Álvarez sings Manrico, the troubadour of the title. The story is well-known already: The gypsy Azucena has harbored a grudge for thirty years, but she is about to have revenge at last. Meanwhile, her son Manrico is in love with Leonora, but so is his arch-enemy, the Count Di Luna. A pot-boiler, where every tune is a hit.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Music\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":475888,\"title\":\"Tell It to the Bees\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/Rj6zpHhMU1zFW3v28U4PSRSRgP.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/Oeo4ZabmekrqCQyn34SI95692d.jpg\",\"rating\":7.5,\"year\":2019,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Dr. Jean Markham returns to the town she left as a teenager to take over her late father's medical practice. When a school-yard scuffle lands Charlie in her surgery, she invites him to visit the hives in her garden and tell his secrets to the bees, as she once did. The new friendship between the boy and the bee keeper brings his mother Lydia into Jean's world.\",\"genres\":[\"Romance\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":287647,\"title\":\"Cart\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/dkLuZTtFGIZdalt06rtntYjJrmP.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/vHNANBOXPFDlHat2pxRZ08gpW9T.jpg\",\"rating\":7.2,\"year\":2014,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"In response to a sudden dismissal of staff, workers at a big retail store begin a protest against their employer's oppressive labor policies.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":21194,\"title\":\"Casi divas\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/5cmSHd37Sov3dJdVjFwr5eGZ3zm.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/fLKY0agYSM8fZKjE99yz1rYCzH7.jpg\",\"rating\":6.6,\"year\":2008,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Four ambitious and beautiful young women. From four very different corners of Mexico. Just like hundreds of others, t